   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITC Trust Fund 2009-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ITC Trust Fund 2009-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer ITC:s arbete med handelsutveckling genom basbudgetst&#xf6;d via ITC Trust Fund. ITC:s verksamhetsm&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att hj&#xe4;lpa den privata sektorn i utvecklings- och transitionsekonomier att st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;retagens konkurrenskraft, utveckling nya handelsfr&#xe4;mjande strategier, och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;elsen f&#xf6;r det regelverk och de avtal som s&#xe4;tter ramverket f&#xf6;r internationell handel.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports ITC&apos;s work in the area of trade development through unearmarked core support via the International Trade Centre Trust Fund. The mission of the ITC is to help the private sector in developing countries and transition economies to strengthen  enterprise competitiveness, develop new trade promotion strategies, and understand the rules governing international trade.</narrative>
  </description>
